From: Freeman Zhang <zhanggyb@lenovo.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Mar 2026 16:19:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Goodix haptic touchpad 27C6:0F90 support

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libinput/libinput/-/merge_requests/1451>

Origin: upstream, https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libinput/libinput/-/commit/a1c5f35a69493a16354391b3dfbac4ad35e3bcab
Bug-Ubuntu: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2146518
Signed-off-by: Bin Li <binli@ubuntu.com>
---
 quirks/30-vendor-goodix.quirks | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/quirks/30-vendor-goodix.quirks b/quirks/30-vendor-goodix.quirks
index b7aab62..e294156 100644
--- a/quirks/30-vendor-goodix.quirks
+++ b/quirks/30-vendor-goodix.quirks
@@ -17,3 +17,11 @@ MatchVendor=0x27C6
 MatchProduct=0x0F95
 MatchUdevType=touchpad
 AttrInputProp=+INPUT_PROP_PRESSUREPAD
+
+# "GXTP5420 Touchpad": pressure touchpad mostly used in Lenovo laptops.
+[Goodix Haptic Touchpad (27C6:0F90)]
+MatchBus=i2c
+MatchVendor=0x27C6
+MatchProduct=0x0F90
+MatchUdevType=touchpad
+AttrInputProp=+INPUT_PROP_PRESSUREPAD
